IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MATRIX-TEST.

*> 這份檢查器不需要修改，是這一題的驗收標準。
*> 它會依序執行學生寫的段落，再檢查結果。

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  CK-V6     PIC S9(6).
01  CK-V3     PIC S9(3).
01  CK-V2     PIC 99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
COBLINGS-TEST-MAIN.
    PERFORM LOAD-MATRIX

    PERFORM SUM-MATRIX
    MOVE WS-TOTAL TO CK-V6
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "SUM-MATRIX：3x4 共 12 格的總和"
              BY CONTENT 78
              BY CONTENT CK-V6

    PERFORM SUM-ROW-TWO
    MOVE WS-ROW-SUM TO CK-V6
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "SUM-ROW-TWO：第 2 列（5+6+7+8）的總和"
              BY CONTENT 26
              BY CONTENT CK-V6

    PERFORM SUM-DIAGONAL
    MOVE WS-DIAGONAL TO CK-V6
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "SUM-DIAGONAL：對角線 1+6+11 的總和"
              BY CONTENT 18
              BY CONTENT CK-V6

    PERFORM FIND-MAX
    MOVE WS-MAX TO CK-V3
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "FIND-MAX：最大的數"
              BY CONTENT 12
              BY CONTENT CK-V3
    MOVE WS-MAX-R TO CK-V2
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "最大值的列下標"
              BY CONTENT 3
              BY CONTENT CK-V2
    MOVE WS-MAX-C TO CK-V2
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "最大值的欄下標"
              BY CONTENT 4
              BY CONTENT CK-V2

    CALL "COBLINGS-DONE"
    GOBACK.
